[
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG01_B001",
    "text": "This is the moment every vibe coder lives for.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 0.0,
    "end_sec": 3.528,
    "duration_sec": 3.528,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG01_B001.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG01_B002",
    "text": "You asked AI to build it. And it did. All of it.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 3.728,
    "end_sec": 9.632,
    "duration_sec": 5.904,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG01_B002.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG01_B003",
    "text": "And then, three seconds later...",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 9.832,
    "end_sec": 12.712,
    "duration_sec": 2.88,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG01_B003.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG01_B004",
    "text": "...it all falls apart.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 12.912,
    "end_sec": 15.096,
    "duration_sec": 2.184,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG01_B004.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG02_B005",
    "text": "Three days ago, Vee discovered something magical.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 15.296,
    "end_sec": 19.136,
    "duration_sec": 3.84,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG02_B005.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG02_B006",
    "text": "You type what you want. AI builds it. Five minutes. Done.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 19.336,
    "end_sec": 26.776,
    "duration_sec": 7.44,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG02_B006.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG02_B007",
    "text": "A to-do app. Done. A database. Done. A login page. Done.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 26.976,
    "end_sec": 36.84,
    "duration_sec": 9.864,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG02_B007.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG02_B008",
    "text": "She thought she could build anything.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 37.04,
    "end_sec": 39.656,
    "duration_sec": 2.616,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG02_B008.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG02_B009",
    "text": "But there was someone who'd seen this story before.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 39.856,
    "end_sec": 43.168,
    "duration_sec": 3.312,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG02_B009.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG02_B010",
    "text": "She couldn't answer.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 43.368,
    "end_sec": 45.456,
    "duration_sec": 2.088,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG02_B010.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B011",
    "text": "Here's an empty lot.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 45.656,
    "end_sec": 47.84,
    "duration_sec": 2.184,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B011.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B012",
    "text": "You want to build something here.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 48.04,
    "end_sec": 50.56,
    "duration_sec": 2.52,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B012.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B013",
    "text": "With a blueprint, you start with the foundation. Then the frame. Then the walls. There's an order. Each piece knows where it goes.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 50.76,
    "end_sec": 62.04,
    "duration_sec": 11.28,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B013.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B014",
    "text": "Without a blueprint?",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 62.24,
    "end_sec": 64.376,
    "duration_sec": 2.136,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B014.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B015",
    "text": "You just... stack. And it goes up. It actually goes up.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 64.576,
    "end_sec": 70.912,
    "duration_sec": 6.336,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B015.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B016",
    "text": "For a while, it looks like it's working.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 71.112,
    "end_sec": 74.208,
    "duration_sec": 3.096,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B016.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B017",
    "text": "Then...",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 74.408,
    "end_sec": 75.896,
    "duration_sec": 1.488,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B017.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B018",
    "text": "A spec is a blueprint. It's not a hundred-page document. It's one sentence: \"What am I building?\"",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 76.096,
    "end_sec": 84.208,
    "duration_sec": 8.112,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B018.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B019",
    "text": "You don't need to know every detail upfront.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 84.408,
    "end_sec": 87.648,
    "duration_sec": 3.24,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B019.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B020",
    "text": "Start with a skateboard. Four wheels. It rolls. That's enough.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 87.848,
    "end_sec": 95.312,
    "duration_sec": 7.464,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B020.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B021",
    "text": "You can always make it bigger later. But you have to know what \"it\" is first.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 95.512,
    "end_sec": 100.96,
    "duration_sec": 5.448,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B021.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG03_B022",
    "text": "That one line? That's where a spec starts.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 101.16,
    "end_sec": 105.408,
    "duration_sec": 4.248,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG03_B022.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG04_B023",
    "text": "Back in the present. Everything still broken.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 105.608,
    "end_sec": 109.928,
    "duration_sec": 4.32,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG04_B023.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG04_B024",
    "text": "And then she did something unusual. She stopped coding.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 110.128,
    "end_sec": 115.072,
    "duration_sec": 4.944,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG04_B024.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG04_B025",
    "text": "She started writing. Not code. Just... what was bothering her.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 115.272,
    "end_sec": 121.704,
    "duration_sec": 6.432,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG04_B025.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG04_B026",
    "text": "And there it was. The question she'd been avoiding.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 121.904,
    "end_sec": 126.416,
    "duration_sec": 4.512,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG04_B026.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG04_B027",
    "text": "Not features. Not tools. The reason. The one sentence that explains everything.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 126.616,
    "end_sec": 135.184,
    "duration_sec": 8.568,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG04_B027.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG04_B028",
    "text": "The same errors. But now, one line makes sense.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 135.384,
    "end_sec": 140.304,
    "duration_sec": 4.92,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG04_B028.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG05_B029",
    "text": "Everything is still broken.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 140.504,
    "end_sec": 143.0,
    "duration_sec": 2.496,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG05_B029.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG05_B030",
    "text": "But now she knows what to fix.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 143.2,
    "end_sec": 145.912,
    "duration_sec": 2.712,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG05_B030.wav"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": "SEG05_B031",
    "text": "...at least, she thinks she does.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "start_sec": 146.112,
    "end_sec": 148.92,
    "duration_sec": 2.808,
    "path": "systems/video/preproduction/ep01/tts_full/audio_segments/SEG05_B031.wav"
  }
]